        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A rank four copy is the same: thumb-size, a tiny grey wolf-shaped doll floating in eerie blue light.",
        "chapters": [
          535
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Its effort can be stacked, and one rank three copy is not enough to refine his hundred man soul.",
