  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan buys rank three Wolf Soul Gu in a Northern Plains market at seven thousand seven hundred primeval stones each, taking all eight in stock. He chooses it so a wolf soul will aid wolf enslavement.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "reg_northern_plains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He pours essence into the final Wolf Soul Gu; it bursts into a grey wolf soul and merges with the hundred man soul. That merge finishes the change into wolfman soul: grey, mostly his own form, with a longer nose bridge, sharper eyes, thinner body, wolf ears, waist-length hair, and a wolf tail. Wolf links grow closer, wolf kings treat him more as their kind, and he can take in about three times more wolf kings than before.",
        "chapters": [
          454
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "final-merge-into-wolfman-soul",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In treasure yellow heaven he buys more Gu recipes and many refinement materials while pursuing rank five Wolf Soul Gu, for a total of eighteen across that purchase.",
        "chapters": [
          493
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "higher-ranks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later has no rank five Wolf Soul Gu and can only use rank four. Refining rank four needs an intact soul of a myriad wolf king; refining rank five needs the soul of a wolf emperor, with about fifty percent success even for a refinement master. Wolf Soul Gu at rank four works clearly on hundred man soul but weakens badly on thousand man soul.",
        "chapters": [
          501
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "higher-ranks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A rank four copy still appears as a thumb-size grey wolf doll in eerie blue light when he uses it to push a thousand man soul toward wolfman soul.",
        "chapters": [
          535
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "higher-ranks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
